促もあり、切に子供がほしい悩める人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな思いとは裏腹に子作りに否定的な態度を見せる旦那。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日をきっかけに温度差を感じ始める夫婦だったが、『子供ができればきっと旦那も――』と一途なゆかりはついに行動を起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまたま旦那と血液型が一緒だった主人公に迫り、既成事実を作ってしまえば旦那との夫婦仲も戻ると信じて疑わないちょっぴり危険で天然な人妻。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はもちろん、両親からの催促もあり、切に子供がほしい悩める人妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな思いとは裏腹に、子作りに否定的な態度を見せる旦那。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温度差を感じているが、“子供ができればきっと旦那も――” と考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまたま旦那と血液型が一緒だった主人公に迫る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"既成事実があれば夫婦仲も戻ると信じて疑わない、ちょっと天然で危険な思考の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「遅くなったけど、ご挨拶させて頂きますね。 私、秋保ゆかりと申します。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44298"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"25 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"159 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8051","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec28ec1098202f17c031ee29a65febbb6e6e1bffb18a2577c573e321474f3037.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c523251df10dc2e7e9faa77ee2c002091b59d2442ae13755decbe179732364b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"渡邊優佳","creatorId":"vndb:s1040","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1040","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1040","name":"渡邊 優佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:189736:44298:24788:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46466","characterName":"室戸 美咲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44299","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"189736"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8052"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46466"},"originalCharacterName":"室戸 美咲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A lonely housewife, who is first introduced to the protagonist by Shiori. Her husband is always busy with work, making her lonely. Her husband has a low sperm count, which makes it hard for them to conceive a child. She's so desperate for a child that she's easily tricked into buying stuff which promises pregnancy."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46466"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見とは裏腹にすでに結婚しており、子作りにも精力的なラブラブ夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし最近旦那の仕事が忙しく、回数も減ってしまい遺伝子も弱り気味な様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病院に通いつつ子作り励むものの、一向に成果が出ずに悩んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『子供ができれば旦那も安心する‥‥』"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そういった焦りからか、主人公から迫られても断れない美咲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イケナイ事だと分かっていても、すべては旦那のため‥‥"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼りないけどお人好し、一途な新妻。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見とは裏腹に既婚者で、子作りにも精力的なラブラブ夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし最近旦那の仕事が忙しく、回数が減って遺伝子も弱り気味な様子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病院に通いつつ子作りに励むものの、一向に成果が出ずに悩んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“子供ができれば旦那も安心する……”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな焦りからか、主人公から迫られても断れない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イケナイことだと分かっていても、すべては旦那のため……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頼りないけどお人好し、一途な新妻。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「でも、もう結婚して2年以上経ってますし、ずっとそう言われるのも少し複雑です。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44299"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"26 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8052","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcc72c570bf96e5aee5295afdceb80996f7096c7fc66291b26a0d958c8722102.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb4438fef014883af9bce327b8a07fba88c0c037a0c978ef5bbd21f13c65a919.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水美紗","creatorId":"vndb:s1975","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1975","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1975","name":"よもぎかすみ(蓬かすみ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:189736:44299:21151:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46467","characterName":"宇美 紀梨香","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44300","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"189736"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8053"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46467"},"originalCharacterName":"宇美 紀梨香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"27"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is first introduced by Shiori to the protagonist. Her reason for wanting to get pregnant is so she can marry her rich boyfriend and live a luxurious and easy life. Due to her boyfriend's strict family, she acts like an elegant girl to her boyfriend so she can gain the approval of his parents."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46467"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"資産家の両親を持つ彼氏は一風変わった家柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供ができて初めて嫁として認められるものの、彼氏の性行為に反してなかなか妊娠できない悩みの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その裏には妊娠できない焦りからくるプレッシャーと、そしてなにより自分自身の昂りが原因だと知る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その矛先はもっと自分を激しく“女”にしてくれる“男”を探し、それは主人公へと向いていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつしか彼氏に対する想いよりも玉の輿に乗ることに必死になっていく紀梨香。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むさぼるように主人公へ迫る肉食系。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼氏は資産家で、子供ができて初めて嫁として認められる一風変わった家柄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし旺盛に行為を重ねてもなかなか妊娠できない悩みを抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プレッシャーからくる焦りと、そしてなにより自分自身の昂りから、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もっと自分を激しく “女” にしてくれる“男”を探してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"むさぼるように主人公へ迫る肉食系。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は一刻も早く妊娠したいの。 それとも何か予定でもある？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"44300"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"27 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8053","sourceWorkId":"23213","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/6067ff55fde7f9276c5efa7cbdd5c5c1d8715d85cfa4a6fd4578d0c6864c8341.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e8/e8d74af6963f206ec1189dccd48d2e43daa886f4f9d39fd9663663eda8d053eb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉ゆき","creatorId":"vndb:s839","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s839","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s839","name":"佐倉 ゆき","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:189736:44300:15997:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c46468","characterName":"如月 れん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"44302","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"189736"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8054"],"vndbCharacterId":"c46468"},"originalCharacterName":"如月 れん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"